A real provider edits through CodeMode, rehearses, and parks the same Omega task for a decision
Real proposal controls fit phone portrait, landscape and tablet viewports
Pocket shows exact proposal choices and retains the task reply without polling the model
Tapping Apply resumes the same real task, which publishes, verifies old-client behavior and finishes
Retrying the exact publication returns its receipt without executing it again
Desktop returns to earlier behavior through shared Changes, retaining accepted work
Unusing Live restores Pocket and every retained editor after real model work
